# Development Principles

Every module developed within Ravion DPR shall follow these standards:

* Business-first architecture
* Modular development
* Reusable components
* Database normalization
* Audit logging
* Role-based access
* Standardized validations
* Responsive design
* Future ERP compatibility

---

# Long-Term Product Vision

Ravion DPR is not intended to remain only a Daily Progress Reporting application.

The long-term vision is to evolve the platform into a complete Construction ERP capable of managing every operational aspect of construction projects, including planning, execution, procurement, inventory, finance integration, analytics, and enterprise reporting.

The architecture has therefore been intentionally designed to support continuous expansion without requiring fundamental redesign of existing modules.

